<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81479" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικατα-λαμβάνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>embrace, enclose, hem in on all
				sides</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				946b38
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>overtake</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικαταλαμβάνει γὰρ ὁ νέος [καρπὸς]
					ἀεὶ τὸν ἔνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					4.2.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.4.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.16.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				4.54
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				20.74
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάλασσα π. τοὺς Αἰγυπτίους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					2.16.3
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Archyt.
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				20.4.1
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῇ ὥρᾳ</span>
			<i>to be overtaken by</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				2.81
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὑπὸ τοῦ ῥεύματος, ὑπὸ τῆς
				φλογός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				400b1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				14.4.10
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικαταλαμβανόμενος τοῖς καιροῖς</span>
			<i>compelled</i> by circumstances, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				16.2.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικαταλαβούσης τῆς ὥρας</span>
			the season <i>having come round</i> or <i>returned</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Od.</u>
				39
			</span></i>.</div>
